.git
.github
# 禁止把 WorkBuddy 在仓库根生成的未跟踪目录带进生产镜像（Dockerfile 有 COPY . .）
.workbuddy
.codex
.cursor
# 2026-09-21 发布源护栏批：工作区里长期存在这三个未跟踪目录，`.dockerignore` 不盖就会
# 跟着 `COPY . .` 进镜像 ——
#   .codex-finalizer-example/  外部助手在仓库根生成的脚手架
#   .ppt-build-example/        示例文旅 PPT 构建目录（含自带 node_modules）
#   deliverables/               PPT 交付产物
# 只做"排除进镜像"，目录本身按用户指示原样保留、未删未动。
.codex-*/
.ppt-build-*/
deliverables/
# 2026-10-25 EXEC-11 发布：UI 改版样稿与本地走查工具（未跟踪的 designs/），同上只排除、不删不动。
# 其中 designs/workbench-redesign/_prod 是指向 ../../public 的软链接。
designs/
# Skills are fetched and verified in their own build stage.
yao-geo
yao-geo-skills
__pycache__
*.pyc
test-results
# 禁止把本地走查垫片带进生产镜像。它是 / 页的一份副本，里面**烧了一张真 Sanctum token**，
# 进了镜像就等于在公网 /__xxx.html 上挂一把钥匙。09-04 内容库走查用过一次，
# 发版前靠人手删掉的 —— 这条是防下一次忘。
public/__*.html
node_modules
vendor
public/build
bootstrap/cache/*.php
docs
frontend
GEOFlow
geo-citation-lab
tests
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
storage/*.key
storage/logs/*
storage/framework/cache/*
storage/framework/sessions/*
storage/framework/views/*
database/*.sqlite
.phpunit.result.cache
*.md
!browser-extension/README.md
# Local image archives are deployment transport artifacts, never application input.
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
# Developer backup artifacts are not application inputs.
*.bak-*
**/*.bak-*

# Local development records and private denylist are never build inputs.
.dev-records

# Preserve third-party license texts and skill overlay instructions.
!**/LICENSE*
!**/NOTICE*
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!licenses/**
!skill-overlays/**/*.md

# Local backups contain private instance data and encryption keys.
.backups/
# Optional operator-specific DNS configuration is not application input.
compose.dns.yml

# These exclusions must remain LAST: earlier license exceptions must never
# re-include local development records, even if they contain LICENSE files.
.dev-records
.dev-records/**
.git
.git/**
